  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CKU Pool RfD (2019-2021) - Center for Church-Based Development (CKU)&apos;s Recycling for Development (RfD) modality 2019-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Recycling for Development (RfD) modality managed by The Center for Church-Based Development (CKU) supports donation of used and recycled equipment and other materials to developing countries. RfD works toward four goals, namely fighting poverty; creating sustainable development through meaningful inclusion of local partners; supporting civil society through donations that contribute to local communities at large; popular anchorage by facilitating small Danish associations&apos; contribution to development work and as a support modality that can engage groups who may not otherwise be participating in such efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
